    cml:operator "=" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Classifies terms into categories" ;
    cml:premiseText "The term 'directions for use' is defined as information on: (a) appropriate doses of the goods; and (b) the method of administration or use of the goods; and (c) the frequency and duration of treatment for each indication of the goods; and (d) the use of the goods by persons of particular ages or by persons having particular medical conditions." ;
    cml:conclusionText "Directions for use, in relation to therapeutic goods, includes information on: (a) appropriate doses of the goods; and (b) the method of administration or use of the goods; and (c) the frequency and duration of treatment for each indication of the goods; and (d) the use of the goods by persons of particular ages or by persons having particular medical conditions." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::dl" ;
    cml:confidence "0.5000"^^xsd:decimal ;
