    skos:prefLabel "3(6) Interpretation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) A reference in this Act to an annual registration charge, an annual listing charge, an annual charge for inclusion in the Register, an annual licensing charge or an annual conformity assessment body determination charge is a reference to such a charge imposed under the Therapeutic Goods (Charges) Act 1989." ;
