concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3(7) Interpretation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) A reference to an offence against this Act includes a reference to: (a) an offence against the regulations; and  Preliminary  Chapter 1  Section 3AA Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (b) an offence against section 6 of the Crimes Act 1914, or section 11.1, 11.4 or 11.5 of the Criminal Code, in relation to an offence against this Act or the regulations; and (c) an offence against section 136.1, 137.1 or 137.2 of the Criminal Code in relation to this Act or the regulations." ;
    skos:definition "(7) A reference to an offence against this Act includes a reference to: (a) an offence against the regulations; and  Preliminary  Chapter 1  Section 3AA Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (b) an offence against section 6 of the Crimes Act 1914, or section 11.1, 11.4 or 11.5 of the Criminal Code, in relation to an offence against this Act or the regulations; and (c) an offence against section 136.1, 137.1 or 137.2 of the Criminal Code in relation to this Act or the regulations."@en ;
