concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3-ss-7a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3(7A) Interpretation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3-ss-7a ;
    values:originalText "(7A) For the purposes of this Act, a corresponding State law imposes a duty on a Commonwealth officer or Commonwealth authority if: (a) the corresponding State law confers a function or power on the officer or authority; and (b) the circumstances in which the function or power is conferred give rise to an obligation on the officer or authority to perform the function or to exercise the power." ;
    skos:definition "(7A) For the purposes of this Act, a corresponding State law imposes a duty on a Commonwealth officer or Commonwealth authority if: (a) the corresponding State law confers a function or power on the officer or authority; and (b) the circumstances in which the function or power is conferred give rise to an obligation on the officer or authority to perform the function or to exercise the power."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dad2a826af5c8026e8470e53d5e0e2cb7b4091c84d99773f2cffbe884f04f139" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3 ;
    cof:pageNumber "17"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Imposes a duty on Commonwealth authorities if corresponding State law confers function or power and gives rise to obligation." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.17" ;
    cml:asserts concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3-ss-7a-norm .
