concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3A Declaration—member of European Community"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may declare, in writing, that a country specified in the declaration is a member of: (a) the European Community; or (b) the European Free Trade Association. (2) A declaration under subsection (1) must be published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website." ;
