concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-5a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5A Application of the Criminal Code—extended geographical"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-5a ;
    values:originalText "jurisdiction Section 15.2 of the Criminal Code (extended geographical jurisdiction—category B) applies to offences against subsections 21A(1), (4) and (4A), sections 22A, 32DO and 41FE, subsections 42DZD(1) and (2) and sections 42DZG, 42DZL, 42E and 42T." ;
    skos:definition "jurisdiction Section 15.2 of the Criminal Code (extended geographical jurisdiction—category B) applies to offences against subsections 21A(1), (4) and (4A), sections 22A, 32DO and 41FE, subsections 42DZD(1) and (2) and sections 42DZG, 42DZL, 42E and 42T."@en ;
