concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6B Review of certain decisions under State laws"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-6b ;
    values:originalText "(1) Application may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal for review of a reviewable State decision. (2) A decision made by the Secretary in the performance of a function, or the exercise of a power, conferred by a corresponding State law is a reviewable State decision for the purpose of this section if: (a) the law under which the decision was made provides for review by the Administrative Review Tribunal; and (b) the decision is declared by the regulations to be a reviewable decision for the purposes of this section.  Preliminary  Chapter 1  Section 6C Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (3) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Administrative Review Tribunal Act 2024 has effect as if a corresponding State law were an Act." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Application may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal for review of a reviewable State decision. (2) A decision made by the Secretary in the performance of a function, or the exercise of a power, conferred by a corresponding State law is a reviewable State decision for the purpose of this section if: (a) the law under which the decision was made provides for review by the Administrative Review Tribunal; and (b) the decision is declared by the regulations to be a reviewable decision for the purposes of this section.  Preliminary  Chapter 1  Section 6C Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (3) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Administrative Review Tribunal Act 2024 has effect as if a corresponding State law were an Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b21feef3a4cd825bbaa1dc89e026114991befe1c631521a820ddc3f12e0941fd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "50"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6b-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6b-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6b-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.50" .
