doc:sec-7-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7(4) Declaration that goods are/are not therapeutic goods" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) If a declaration under this section: (a) is a declaration that classes of goods are not therapeutic goods; and (b) applies wholly or partly to goods that, apart from this section, would be medical devices;  Chapter 1  Preliminary  Section 7AAA Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 the goods are not medical devices, or are not medical devices when used, advertised, or presented for supply in the way specified in the declaration. 7AAA  Minister may determine that goods are therapeutic goods" ;
    cof:pageNumber "51"^^xsd:integer .

