concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-7-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7(2) Declaration that goods are/are not therapeutic goods"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-7-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Before making a determination under subsection (1), the Minister: (a) must have regard to the following matters: (i) whether it is likely that the specified goods, if not regulated under this Act, might harm the health of members of the public; (ii) whether it is appropriate in all the circumstances to apply the national system of controls relating to the quality, safety, efficacy and performance of therapeutic goods established by this Act to regulate the specified goods; (iii) whether the kinds of risks from the specified goods to which members of the public might be exposed could be more appropriately dealt with under another regulatory scheme; and (b) may have regard to any other relevant matter." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Before making a determination under subsection (1), the Minister: (a) must have regard to the following matters: (i) whether it is likely that the specified goods, if not regulated under this Act, might harm the health of members of the public; (ii) whether it is appropriate in all the circumstances to apply the national system of controls relating to the quality, safety, efficacy and performance of therapeutic goods established by this Act to regulate the specified goods; (iii) whether the kinds of risks from the specified goods to which members of the public might be exposed could be more appropriately dealt with under another regulatory scheme; and (b) may have regard to any other relevant matter."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2fc439d34c27e4c639531f6ed6e4489d5cb149aae973396bb8f7ef9d2e563fb3" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-7 ;
    cof:pageNumber "51"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Goods are not therapeutic goods under certain conditions. Minister must consider certain matters before making a determination about regulating goods." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
