concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-7a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7A Authorised persons"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-7a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Secretary may, in writing, authorise any of the following persons to exercise powers under a specified provision of this Act: (a) an officer of the Department, of another Department or of an authority of the Commonwealth; (b) an officer of: (i) a Department of State of a State; or (ii) a Department or administrative unit of the Public Service of a Territory; or  Chapter 1  Preliminary  Section 7B Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (iii) an authority of a State or of a Territory; being a Department, unit or authority that has functions relating to health matters or law enforcement matters. (2) In exercising a power under a provision of this Act under an authorisation under subsection (1), the authorised person must comply with any directions of the Secretary." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Secretary may, in writing, authorise any of the following persons to exercise powers under a specified provision of this Act: (a) an officer of the Department, of another Department or of an authority of the Commonwealth; (b) an officer of: (i) a Department of State of a State; or (ii) a Department or administrative unit of the Public Service of a Territory; or  Chapter 1  Preliminary  Section 7B Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (iii) an authority of a State or of a Territory; being a Department, unit or authority that has functions relating to health matters or law enforcement matters. (2) In exercising a power under a provision of this Act under an authorisation under subsection (1), the authorised person must comply with any directions of the Secretary."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3c8e73b31a0d86e983b15656d7421ab2bf89647be34c1a12308595b56417c0a4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "53"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-7a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-7a-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
