    skos:prefLabel "8(4) Power to obtain information with respect to therapeutic goods"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-8-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) An offence under subsection (2) is an offence of strict liability. Note: For strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code." ;
