concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Arrangements with States etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may make arrangements with the appropriate Minister of a State, of the Australian Capital Territory or of the Northern Territory for the carrying out by that State or Territory, on behalf of the Commonwealth, of: (a) the evaluation of therapeutic goods for registration; or (aa) the evaluation of a biological, other than a Class 1 biological or an export only biological, for inclusion in the Register under Part 3-2A; or  Preliminary  Chapter 1  Section 9 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (b) the inspection of manufacturers of therapeutic goods; or (c) other functions under this Act or the regulations. (2) An arrangement under this section may provide for the payment to a State or Territory of amounts in respect of the performance of functions under the arrangement.  Chapter 2  Australian Register of Therapeutic Goods  Section 9A Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 Chapter 2—Australian Register of Therapeutic Goods" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may make arrangements with the appropriate Minister of a State, of the Australian Capital Territory or of the Northern Territory for the carrying out by that State or Territory, on behalf of the Commonwealth, of: (a) the evaluation of therapeutic goods for registration; or (aa) the evaluation of a biological, other than a Class 1 biological or an export only biological, for inclusion in the Register under Part 3-2A; or  Preliminary  Chapter 1  Section 9 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (b) the inspection of manufacturers of therapeutic goods; or (c) other functions under this Act or the regulations. (2) An arrangement under this section may provide for the payment to a State or Territory of amounts in respect of the performance of functions under the arrangement.  Chapter 2  Australian Register of Therapeutic Goods  Section 9A Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 Chapter 2—Australian Register of Therapeutic Goods"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e0fc9aa66a66bac09f5bd90b161ef68bdd8e83334eaf9687737875abfa62330c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "56"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9-ss-2 ;
