    values:originalText "(2) If: (a) the person in relation to whom therapeutic goods are registered or listed has requested the Secretary to vary information included in the entry in the Register that relates to the goods; and (b) the only effect of the variation would be: (i) to reduce the class of persons for whom the goods are suitable; or (ii) to add a warning, or precaution, that does not include any comparison of the goods with any other therapeutic goods by reference to quality, safety or efficacy; the Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If: (a) the person in relation to whom therapeutic goods are registered or listed has requested the Secretary to vary information included in the entry in the Register that relates to the goods; and (b) the only effect of the variation would be: (i) to reduce the class of persons for whom the goods are suitable; or (ii) to add a warning, or precaution, that does not include any comparison of the goods with any other therapeutic goods by reference to quality, safety or efficacy; the Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request."@en ;
