concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-2c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9D(2C) Variation of entries in Register"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9d-ss-2c ;
    values:originalText "(2C) If: (a) the person in relation to whom therapeutic goods are registered or listed has requested the Secretary to vary the entry in the Register that relates to the goods; and (b) the variation is of a kind specified in the regulations; and (c) the conditions (if any) specified in the regulations are satisfied; the Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request." ;
    skos:definition "(2C) If: (a) the person in relation to whom therapeutic goods are registered or listed has requested the Secretary to vary the entry in the Register that relates to the goods; and (b) the variation is of a kind specified in the regulations; and (c) the conditions (if any) specified in the regulations are satisfied; the Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request."@en ;
