doc:sec-9d-ss-3a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "9D(3A) Variation of entries in Register" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3A) If: (a) the person in relation to whom a biological is included in the Register has requested the Secretary to vary information included in the entry in the Register that relates to the biological; and  Australian Register of Therapeutic Goods  Chapter 2  Section 9D Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (aa) subsection (3AA) does not apply to the request; and (ab) subsection (3AC) does not apply to the request; and (b) the Secretary is satisfied that the variation requested does not indicate any reduction in the quality, safety or efficacy of the biological for the purposes for which it is to be used; the Secretary may vary the entry in accordance with the request." ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9D(3B) Variation of entries in Register"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9d-ss-3b ;
    values:originalText "(3B) If: (a) a particular biological ceases to be a biological because of a determination under subsection 32A(3); and (b) the biological is included in the Register under Part 3-2A; the Secretary must move the entry relating to the biological from the part of the Register for biologicals to whichever other part of the Register is applicable." ;
    skos:definition "(3B) If: (a) a particular biological ceases to be a biological because of a determination under subsection 32A(3); and (b) the biological is included in the Register under Part 3-2A; the Secretary must move the entry relating to the biological from the part of the Register for biologicals to whichever other part of the Register is applicable."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b21e1e9da45f15a88d019c656873026c68501ede9c65b35b3758112ea02ddff0" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Secretary must move entry from part of Register for biologicals to applicable part." ;
