doc:sec-9d-ss-8 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "9D(8) Variation of entries in Register" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(8) The Secretary may, by legislative instrument, determine a kind of information for the purposes of subparagraph (7)(g)(i). Note: See also subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
