concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9f-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9F(6) Removal of entries from Register"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9f-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If the Secretary removes an entry of goods from the Register under this section, the removal has effect on the day specified in the notice under subsection (2) in relation to the goods, being a day not earlier than 20 working days after the day on which the notice is given to the person." ;
    skos:definition "(6) If the Secretary removes an entry of goods from the Register under this section, the removal has effect on the day specified in the notice under subsection (2) in relation to the goods, being a day not earlier than 20 working days after the day on which the notice is given to the person."@en ;
