concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9f-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9F(7) Removal of entries from Register"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9f-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) If the Secretary removes an entry of goods from the Register under this section, the Secretary must, as soon as practicable after the removal, cause to be published in the Gazette, or on the Department’s website, a notice setting out particulars of the removal." ;
    skos:definition "(7) If the Secretary removes an entry of goods from the Register under this section, the Secretary must, as soon as practicable after the removal, cause to be published in the Gazette, or on the Department’s website, a notice setting out particulars of the removal."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8161738457e3877d2d02251f316a0d1fcc828b9104b3de2d39ffcd6f8f5eefec" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9f ;
