concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9k-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9K(6) Prohibition on import, export, manufacture or supply of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9k-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Regulations containing a prohibition referred to in subsection (1) or (3) must not be made unless: (a) the Minister causes to be published on the Department’s website a notice setting out details of: (i) the international agreement; and (ii) the Minister’s satisfaction mentioned in subsection (2) or (4); and (iii) the proposed prohibition; and (b) a period of 30 days has passed since the notice was published. Commencement of regulations containing prohibition" ;
    skos:definition "(6) Regulations containing a prohibition referred to in subsection (1) or (3) must not be made unless: (a) the Minister causes to be published on the Department’s website a notice setting out details of: (i) the international agreement; and (ii) the Minister’s satisfaction mentioned in subsection (2) or (4); and (iii) the proposed prohibition; and (b) a period of 30 days has passed since the notice was published. Commencement of regulations containing prohibition"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "90748b5f61c3cea7534e2e8c8d75ee7240390991609fc7ab3ddd2fcc363596f4" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9k ;
    cof:pageNumber "69"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Regulations containing a prohibition must be published and wait 30 days before implementation." ;
    dc:description "(i) the international agreement; (ii) the Minister’s satisfaction; (iii) the proposed prohibition" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.69" ;
