concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9k-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9K(7) Prohibition on import, export, manufacture or supply of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9k-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) Regulations containing a prohibition referred to in subsection (1) or (3) must not be expressed to commence on a day earlier than the day the international agreement enters into force for Australia. Content of regulations containing prohibition" ;
