concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9k-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9K(8) Prohibition on import, export, manufacture or supply of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9k-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) Without limiting subsection (5), regulations prescribing conditions referred to in that subsection may do one or more of the following: (a) make provision in relation to a matter by conferring on the Minister or Secretary a power to make a decision of an administrative character; (b) refer to the Minister or Secretary being satisfied of one or more specified matters; (c) make provision for and in relation to the Minister or Secretary delegating powers to an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the Department." ;
    skos:definition "(8) Without limiting subsection (5), regulations prescribing conditions referred to in that subsection may do one or more of the following: (a) make provision in relation to a matter by conferring on the Minister or Secretary a power to make a decision of an administrative character; (b) refer to the Minister or Secretary being satisfied of one or more specified matters; (c) make provision for and in relation to the Minister or Secretary delegating powers to an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the Department."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "db29f6246b2ea2103822fbb9d3b5941d6a90f6bd69503813aa7342e156cb5ab8" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9k ;
    cof:pageNumber "69"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Regulations may confer power on Minister or Secretary to make administrative decisions." ;
