concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-10-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10(4) Determination of standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, an order under subsection (1) of this section, or a variation of such an order, may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained in an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time to time.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, an order under subsection (1) of this section, or a variation of such an order, may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained in an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time to time.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "52046a47fc4bce7b893fb6f69f731205e0c09189c24efaea579396237c5ac80b" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-10 ;
