concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13(5) Special provisions relating to Ministerial standards and default"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-13-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If: (a) therapeutic goods consist, or are represented to consist, of a mixture of ingredients or of a combination of component parts; and (b) there is no standard applicable to the mixture or combination but a standard is applicable to one or more of the ingredients or one or more of the component parts; the Minister may, by order published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website, determine that the standard does not apply to the goods. The order has effect accordingly." ;
    skos:definition "(5) If: (a) therapeutic goods consist, or are represented to consist, of a mixture of ingredients or of a combination of component parts; and (b) there is no standard applicable to the mixture or combination but a standard is applicable to one or more of the ingredients or one or more of the component parts; the Minister may, by order published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website, determine that the standard does not apply to the goods. The order has effect accordingly."@en ;
