concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13(7) Special provisions relating to Ministerial standards and default"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-13-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) For the purposes of this Act, in working out at a particular time if therapeutic goods conform with a default standard applicable to the goods, if: (a) after applying subsections (2) to (5), 2 or more default standards are applicable to the goods at that time; and (b) at that time, the goods conform with at least one of those standards but do not conform with at least one of those standards; then the default standards that the goods do not conform with are taken not to apply to the goods at that time." ;
    skos:definition "(7) For the purposes of this Act, in working out at a particular time if therapeutic goods conform with a default standard applicable to the goods, if: (a) after applying subsections (2) to (5), 2 or more default standards are applicable to the goods at that time; and (b) at that time, the goods conform with at least one of those standards but do not conform with at least one of those standards; then the default standards that the goods do not conform with are taken not to apply to the goods at that time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "65ee93d28d0dc45a098a41c28a4a0434d6ea652e82c4139303b25b33e5d2a9b4" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13 ;
    cof:pageNumber "76"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "If multiple default standards apply, they are taken not to apply if goods conform with at least one but not all." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.76" ;
