concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13A Special provisions relating to homoeopathic standards and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-13a ;
    values:originalText "anthroposophic standards (1) For the purposes of this Act, if a statement (the main statement) in a monograph in a homoeopathic pharmacopoeia or an anthroposophic pharmacopoeia refers to a statement in a monograph in another publication, the main statement is taken to include the other statement.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "anthroposophic standards (1) For the purposes of this Act, if a statement (the main statement) in a monograph in a homoeopathic pharmacopoeia or an anthroposophic pharmacopoeia refers to a statement in a monograph in another publication, the main statement is taken to include the other statement.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0550e76a3096121d9b65c4ac809b9b3e78d680315a4369bec6571140eb8170cf" ;
    cof:pageNumber "77"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "If a statement in a monograph refers to another statement, the main statement includes the other statement." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.77" ;
