doc:sec-14-ss-4a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "14(4A) Criminal offences for importing, supplying or exporting goods" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4A) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person imports therapeutic goods into Australia; and (b) the goods are imported without the consent in writing of the Secretary; and (c) the goods do not conform with a standard applicable to the goods (other than by reason of a matter relating to labelling or packaging). Penalty: 100 penalty units." ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer .

