    values:originalText "(5A) Subsection (1), (4) or (4A) does not apply if: (a) the therapeutic goods are a biological; and (b) the person imports the biological after the circumstances prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph have occurred. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in subsection (5A): see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code. Offences relating to supplying goods for use in Australia" ;
