concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19(2) Approvals or authorities for certain uses"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-19-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) An application for an approval must be made to the Secretary and must: (a) in the case of an application for use of the kind referred to in paragraph (1)(a)—be in a form (if any) approved, in writing, by the Secretary and be accompanied by such information relating to the goods the subject of the application as is required by the Secretary; and (b) in the case of an application for use of the kind referred to in paragraph (1)(b): (i) be in a form (if any) approved, in writing, by the Secretary; and (ii) be accompanied by such information relating to the goods the subject of the application as is required by the Secretary; and (iii) be accompanied by the prescribed evaluation fee.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Preliminary  Division 1 Section 19 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(2) An application for an approval must be made to the Secretary and must: (a) in the case of an application for use of the kind referred to in paragraph (1)(a)—be in a form (if any) approved, in writing, by the Secretary and be accompanied by such information relating to the goods the subject of the application as is required by the Secretary; and (b) in the case of an application for use of the kind referred to in paragraph (1)(b): (i) be in a form (if any) approved, in writing, by the Secretary; and (ii) be accompanied by such information relating to the goods the subject of the application as is required by the Secretary; and (iii) be accompanied by the prescribed evaluation fee.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Preliminary  Division 1 Section 19 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0b8e578f3db5a8de62b31c3747a5eeb555da57071d6f3b281f59880be47d7daf" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19 ;
    cof:pageNumber "96"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application for approval must be made to the Secretary and meet certain requirements." ;
    dc:description "Information relating to goods subject to application, evaluation fee" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
