concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-22d a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22D Provisional determinations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-22d ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a person makes an application, in accordance with subsection 22C(2), for a provisional determination relating to a medicine, the Secretary must decide to make, or to refuse to make, the determination.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If a person makes an application, in accordance with subsection 22C(2), for a provisional determination relating to a medicine, the Secretary must decide to make, or to refuse to make, the determination.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "87f857880be4cab55d90a591fec34adfd14e773dfaf78197a4393079675dbd1c" ;
