concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-22e-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22E(9) Period during which provisional determination is in force"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-22e-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) If the person to whom the provisional determination relates makes an application under section 23 for provisional registration of the medicine before the end of the initial period (or that period as extended), the determination remains in force until:  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(9) If the person to whom the provisional determination relates makes an application under section 23 for provisional registration of the medicine before the end of the initial period (or that period as extended), the determination remains in force until:  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
