    cof:title "22G(9) Scientific advice about aspects of quality, safety or efficacy of" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(9) An approval of a form may require or permit a request, information or a document to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
