concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-23a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23A Classes of therapeutic goods"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Secretary may, by notifiable instrument, specify different classes of therapeutic goods for the purposes of section 23B. (2) Without limiting subsection (1), a class of therapeutic goods may be specified by reference to one or more of the matters referred to in paragraphs 16(1)(a) to (g) or 16(1A)(a) to (d)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Secretary may, by notifiable instrument, specify different classes of therapeutic goods for the purposes of section 23B. (2) Without limiting subsection (1), a class of therapeutic goods may be specified by reference to one or more of the matters referred to in paragraphs 16(1)(a) to (g) or 16(1A)(a) to (d)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c752610b64371c4eaec9dba78b58a1f9b76bd67afed5eadab4d53ea6205edb79" ;
    cof:pageNumber "141"^^xsd:integer ;
