concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-23b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23B Requirements relating to applications for registration of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23b ;
    values:originalText "therapeutic goods and listing of medicines under section 26AE (1) If an application is made under section 23 for: (a) registration of therapeutic goods (including an application for provisional registration of a medicine); or (b) the listing of a medicine under section 26AE; the Secretary must carry out an assessment of whether the requirements set out in subsection (2) have been met in relation to the application. (2) The requirements are as follows: (a) the application must be made: (i) in accordance with the form approved, in writing, by the Secretary for that class of therapeutic goods; or (ii) in such other manner as is approved, in writing, by the Secretary for that class of therapeutic goods;  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "therapeutic goods and listing of medicines under section 26AE (1) If an application is made under section 23 for: (a) registration of therapeutic goods (including an application for provisional registration of a medicine); or (b) the listing of a medicine under section 26AE; the Secretary must carry out an assessment of whether the requirements set out in subsection (2) have been met in relation to the application. (2) The requirements are as follows: (a) the application must be made: (i) in accordance with the form approved, in writing, by the Secretary for that class of therapeutic goods; or (ii) in such other manner as is approved, in writing, by the Secretary for that class of therapeutic goods;  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f7974b3170ae19f70aa86c6f735ac1423d5e09a3482dcd31a792b5bd0ad3229d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "141"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-23b-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-23b-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.141" .
