concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-23b-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23B(1) Requirements relating to applications for registration of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23b-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If an application is made under section 23 for: (a) registration of therapeutic goods (including an application for provisional registration of a medicine); or (b) the listing of a medicine under section 26AE; the Secretary must carry out an assessment of whether the requirements set out in subsection (2) have been met in relation to the application." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If an application is made under section 23 for: (a) registration of therapeutic goods (including an application for provisional registration of a medicine); or (b) the listing of a medicine under section 26AE; the Secretary must carry out an assessment of whether the requirements set out in subsection (2) have been met in relation to the application."@en ;
