concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-24e-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24E(4) Deemed refusal of application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-24e-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Where a notice has been given, this Act (except for subsection 60(5)) has effect as if: (a) the Secretary had decided not to register the goods the subject of the application; and (b) the Minister had made a decision under subsection 60(3) confirming the decision of the Secretary; and (c) the Minister’s decision had been made on the day on which notice was given to the Secretary under subsection (2).  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 25 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Where a notice has been given, this Act (except for subsection 60(5)) has effect as if: (a) the Secretary had decided not to register the goods the subject of the application; and (b) the Minister had made a decision under subsection 60(3) confirming the decision of the Secretary; and (c) the Minister’s decision had been made on the day on which notice was given to the Secretary under subsection (2).  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 25 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4b5fa4a40f2f3ccb0d4ea9106b99d35608c7cfd2e677414343f75e8cec84f29e" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-24e ;
    cof:pageNumber "148"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Deemed refusal of application" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
