concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ab a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26AB Application for listing of certain medicines following efficacy"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26ab ;
    values:originalText "evaluation (1) If: (a) an application is made under section 23 for the listing of medicine in relation to a person; and (b) the application passes preliminary assessment; and (c) the requirements of subsections (2), (3), (4) and (6) have been complied with; and (d) the medicine is not a medicine which may be listed under section 26A; and (e) the medicine is not export only medicine; and  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "evaluation (1) If: (a) an application is made under section 23 for the listing of medicine in relation to a person; and (b) the application passes preliminary assessment; and (c) the requirements of subsections (2), (3), (4) and (6) have been complied with; and (d) the medicine is not a medicine which may be listed under section 26A; and (e) the medicine is not export only medicine; and  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "50d1c4821a4146f9310da915d494bfd8462576196622274227ede249165f5053" ;
    cof:pageNumber "169"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application for listing of certain medicines following efficacy" ;
