concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ad-ss-1 cml:asserts concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ad-ss-1-logic-deontic-1 .
concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ad-ss-1-logic-deontic-1 a cml:LogicApplication ;
