concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ad-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26AD(3) Lapsing and deemed refusal of applications for listing of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26ad-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A notice under subsection (2) may be given at any time before the evaluation is completed.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 26AE Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(3) A notice under subsection (2) may be given at any time before the evaluation is completed.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 26AE Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f6935edd328a78ea5580293618e2d1cf082e2be98d62e6e5126d9a47add65522" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ad ;
