concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ad-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26AD(4) Lapsing and deemed refusal of applications for listing of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26ad-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If a notice has been given, this Act (except subsection 60(5)) has effect as if: (a) the Secretary had decided not to list the medicine which is the subject of the application; and (b) the Minister had made a decision under subsection 60(3) confirming the decision of the Secretary; and (c) the Minister’s decision had been made on the day on which notice was given to the Secretary under subsection (2)." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If a notice has been given, this Act (except subsection 60(5)) has effect as if: (a) the Secretary had decided not to list the medicine which is the subject of the application; and (b) the Minister had made a decision under subsection 60(3) confirming the decision of the Secretary; and (c) the Minister’s decision had been made on the day on which notice was given to the Secretary under subsection (2)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d6c60b67c7ca0387b59b91f297b815ad1334a0a74ded09b97115d5a5ebad5263" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ad ;
    cof:pageNumber "174"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Refusal of listing of medicine without notice" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
