concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ae a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26AE Evaluation and listing of certain medicines"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26ae ;
    values:originalText "Evaluation (1) If: (a) an application is made under section 23 for the listing of a medicine in relation to a person under this section; and (b) the application has passed preliminary assessment; the Secretary must evaluate the medicine having regard to:  (c) whether the efficacy of the medicine for the purposes for which it is to be used has been satisfactorily established; and (d) such other matters (if any) as the Secretary considers relevant. Note: The Secretary must not use restricted information when evaluating the medicine for listing: see section 26AF. (2) If a period in relation to which an evaluation under this section must be completed has been prescribed under paragraph 63(2)(daaaa), the evaluation must be completed within that period. Secretary must decide whether to list medicine (3) After an evaluation under this section of goods has been completed, the Secretary must decide: (a) to list the medicine; or (b) not to list the medicine.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "Evaluation (1) If: (a) an application is made under section 23 for the listing of a medicine in relation to a person under this section; and (b) the application has passed preliminary assessment; the Secretary must evaluate the medicine having regard to:  (c) whether the efficacy of the medicine for the purposes for which it is to be used has been satisfactorily established; and (d) such other matters (if any) as the Secretary considers relevant. Note: The Secretary must not use restricted information when evaluating the medicine for listing: see section 26AF. (2) If a period in relation to which an evaluation under this section must be completed has been prescribed under paragraph 63(2)(daaaa), the evaluation must be completed within that period. Secretary must decide whether to list medicine (3) After an evaluation under this section of goods has been completed, the Secretary must decide: (a) to list the medicine; or (b) not to list the medicine.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "163e44b102626149bbbfb058eee4fcfa7748b40949629e0a1a4ff058f3bb548b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "175"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ae-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ae-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ae-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.175" .
doc:sec-26ae a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26AE Evaluation and listing of certain medicines" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Evaluation (1) If: (a) an application is made under section 23 for the listing of a medicine in relation to a person under this section; and (b) the application has passed preliminary assessment; the Secretary must evaluate the medicine having regard to:  (c) whether the efficacy of the medicine for the purposes for which it is to be used has been satisfactorily established; and (d) such other matters (if any) as the Secretary considers relevant. Note: The Secretary must not use restricted information when evaluating the medicine for listing: see section 26AF. (2) If a period in relation to which an evaluation under this section must be completed has been prescribed under paragraph 63(2)(daaaa), the evaluation must be completed within that period. Secretary must decide whether to list medicine (3) After an evaluation under this section of goods has been completed, the Secretary must decide: (a) to list the medicine; or (b) not to list the medicine.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    cof:pageNumber "175"^^xsd:integer .

