    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination specifying either or both of the following: (a) ingredients; (b) for some or all of those ingredients—requirements in relation to those ingredients being contained in medicine. Note: A person seeking the listing of a medicine under section 26A or 26AB must certify that: (a) the medicine does not contain an ingredient that is not specified in the determination; and (b) none of the requirements specified in the determination in relation to ingredients being contained in the medicine have been contravened. Requirements" ;
