concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bb-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26BB(8) Permissible ingredients"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26bb-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, a determination under this section may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating any matter contained in an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time to time." ;
    skos:definition "(8) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, a determination under this section may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating any matter contained in an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time to time."@en ;
