doc:sec-26bf-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26BF(2) Permissible indications" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) In deciding whether to make a determination under subsection (1) in relation to a particular indication, the Minister may have regard to whether the indication is a therapeutic use that relates to one or more of the following: (a) maintaining health; (b) enhancing health; (c) preventing a dietary deficiency;  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 26BG Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (d) a disease, ailment, defect or injury, other than a serious form of the disease, ailment, defect or injury." ;
    cof:pageNumber "186"^^xsd:integer .

