    skos:prefLabel "26BF(3) Permissible indications"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26bf-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (2) does not limit the matters to which the Minister may have regard in deciding whether to make a determination under subsection (1) in relation to a particular indication." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subsection (2) does not limit the matters to which the Minister may have regard in deciding whether to make a determination under subsection (1) in relation to a particular indication."@en ;
