concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bf-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26BF(6) Permissible indications"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26bf-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, a determination under subsection (1) of this section may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained in an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time to time." ;
    skos:definition "(6) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, a determination under subsection (1) of this section may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained in an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time to time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d19355e47e9764bec9ee3e6e7aa48788613f60a8905b0e811e1e0fd852061fad" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bf ;
    cof:pageNumber "186"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Allows for incorporation of existing instruments or writings with modifications." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
