concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26BG Limitations on determination under section 26BF"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26bg ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination specifying indications that must not be covered by a determination under paragraph 26BF(1)(a). (2) The determination may specify an indication either generally or in relation to specified circumstances. (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, vary or revoke a determination under subsection (1)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination specifying indications that must not be covered by a determination under paragraph 26BF(1)(a). (2) The determination may specify an indication either generally or in relation to specified circumstances. (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, vary or revoke a determination under subsection (1)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "55bdd097e548ead956e2cbcdd96b2be1dc3d49a3cb3ee449f78902b31a950caa" ;
    cof:pageNumber "187"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bg-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bg-ss-2 ;
