concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bj-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26BJ(2) Variation of determination under section 26BF—application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26bj-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) An application under subsection (1) must: (a) be made in accordance with a form approved, in writing, by the Secretary; and (b) set out the recommendation sought; and (c) be delivered to an office of the Department specified in the form; and (d) be accompanied by the prescribed application fee (if any). Limits on kinds of applications that can be made" ;
