concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bj-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26BJ(3) Variation of determination under section 26BF—application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26bj-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person cannot make an application under subsection (1) for a recommendation the effect of which would be for the determination to cover any of the following: (a) an indication specified in a determination under section 26BG; (b) an indication that is or contains a restricted representation (within the meaning of Part 5-1); (c) unless subsection (4) applies—an indication that is or contains a prohibited representation (within the meaning of" ;
