    values:originalText "(3) Subject to this section, the provisional registration period, for a medicine that is provisionally registered because of an application that, under subsection 23AA(1), is taken to be an application for provisional registration of the medicine, is the period of 2 years starting on the day the registration commences.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 29 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 Note: Subsection 25AB(6) provides that registration commences on the day specified in the certificate of registration." ;
