doc:sec-29a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "29A(1) Criminal offence for failing to notify adverse effects etc. of" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) As soon as a person in relation to whom therapeutic goods are registered or listed becomes aware of information of a kind mentioned in subsection (2) relating to the goods, the person must give the information to the Secretary in writing. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or both. Note: For the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see sections 54B and 54BA." ;
