    skos:prefLabel "29B Notification of adverse effects etc. where application withdrawn"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-29b ;
    values:originalText "or lapses (1) If an application for registration or listing of goods is withdrawn or lapses, the Secretary may give the applicant written notice requiring the applicant:  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "or lapses (1) If an application for registration or listing of goods is withdrawn or lapses, the Secretary may give the applicant written notice requiring the applicant:  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
