concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29C Civil penalties for failing to notify adverse effects etc. where"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-29c ;
    values:originalText "application withdrawn or lapses Civil penalty for failing to comply with requirements of a notice (1) A person contravenes this subsection if the person does not comply with the requirements of a notice under subsection 29B(1) within 30 days after the day on which the notice is given to the person. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—3,000 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—30,000 penalty units.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 29D Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 Civil penalty for giving false or misleading information in purported compliance with requirements of a notice (2) A person contravenes this subsection if the person, in purported compliance with a notice under subsection 29B(1), gives information that is false or misleading in a material particular. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—3,000 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—30,000 penalty units." ;
    skos:definition "application withdrawn or lapses Civil penalty for failing to comply with requirements of a notice (1) A person contravenes this subsection if the person does not comply with the requirements of a notice under subsection 29B(1) within 30 days after the day on which the notice is given to the person. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—3,000 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—30,000 penalty units.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 29D Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 Civil penalty for giving false or misleading information in purported compliance with requirements of a notice (2) A person contravenes this subsection if the person, in purported compliance with a notice under subsection 29B(1), gives information that is false or misleading in a material particular. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—3,000 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—30,000 penalty units."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "26f7008a3e14c5f1b0690933aaf97973ebb7934e05f46482c7347b1adb2ee083" ;
    cof:pageNumber "208"^^xsd:integer ;
