concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30aa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30AA Revocation of cancellation of registration or listing—payment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30aa ;
    values:originalText "of annual registration or listing charge (1) If: (a) the Secretary cancels the registration or listing of therapeutic goods because the annual registration or listing charge was not paid within 28 days after it became payable (see paragraph 30(1)(h)); and (b) before the end of the period of 90 days beginning on the day the goods ceased to be registered or listed, the person requests, in writing, the Secretary to revoke the cancellation; and (c) the annual registration or listing charge has been paid; and (d) the request is accompanied by the prescribed application fee; the Secretary may, by notice in writing given to the person, revoke the cancellation. (2) If the cancellation is revoked, the cancellation is taken never to have occurred.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 30B Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    skos:definition "of annual registration or listing charge (1) If: (a) the Secretary cancels the registration or listing of therapeutic goods because the annual registration or listing charge was not paid within 28 days after it became payable (see paragraph 30(1)(h)); and (b) before the end of the period of 90 days beginning on the day the goods ceased to be registered or listed, the person requests, in writing, the Secretary to revoke the cancellation; and (c) the annual registration or listing charge has been paid; and (d) the request is accompanied by the prescribed application fee; the Secretary may, by notice in writing given to the person, revoke the cancellation. (2) If the cancellation is revoked, the cancellation is taken never to have occurred.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 30B Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0e6b489dd51eb00a9693aac35d8d430ea01aacd680fdec31cb9aa822bacb1ce7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "218"^^xsd:integer ;
