    values:originalText "(1) This section applies to an application for listing or registration of a therapeutic good under section 23 if: (a) the therapeutic good is, or contains, a GM product or a genetically modified organism; and (b) if the application is for registration—the application has passed preliminary assessment; and (c) if the application is for the listing of a medicine under section 26AE—the application has passed preliminary assessment." ;
