doc:sec-30c-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "30C(5) Consultation with Gene Technology Regulator" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) If an advice from the Gene Technology Regulator is in force under section 30D in relation to a class of therapeutic goods, the Secretary is not required to notify the Regulator under this section in relation to an application for listing or registration of a therapeutic good belonging to that class.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
