concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30E Secretary to take advice into account"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30e ;
    values:originalText "If the Secretary receives advice from the Gene Technology Regulator: (a) in response to a notice under section 30C within the period specified in the notice; or (b) under section 30D; the Secretary must: (c) ensure that the advice is taken into account in making a decision on the application to which the notice relates, or on an application to which the advice under section 30D relates, as the case requires; and  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 30E Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (d) inform the Gene Technology Regulator of the decision on the application.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "If the Secretary receives advice from the Gene Technology Regulator: (a) in response to a notice under section 30C within the period specified in the notice; or (b) under section 30D; the Secretary must: (c) ensure that the advice is taken into account in making a decision on the application to which the notice relates, or on an application to which the advice under section 30D relates, as the case requires; and  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 Registration and listing  Division 2 Section 30E Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (d) inform the Gene Technology Regulator of the decision on the application.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "67fbe04aaecb63a7368b814ab4868ec8f0e93a1c24186726976d9aa9da80a685" ;
    cof:pageNumber "220"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Secretary must take advice from Gene Technology Regulator into account when making decisions on applications." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.220" ;
