concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30eb a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30EB Publication of requirements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30eb ;
    values:originalText "The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website, as soon as practicable after imposing a requirement under section 30EA, a notice setting out particulars of the requirement." ;
