concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30ef-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30EF(6) Reporting medicine shortages"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30ef-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) A person contravenes this subsection if: (a) the person is subject to a requirement under subsection (1); and (b) the person contravenes the requirement. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—100 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—1,000 penalty units. Exceptions" ;
    skos:definition "(6) A person contravenes this subsection if: (a) the person is subject to a requirement under subsection (1); and (b) the person contravenes the requirement. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—100 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—1,000 penalty units. Exceptions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4f8907e2f2adadcaf6ae9fd8ec831e5902ba6b417846ebbccb3a77a6976a31c5" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30ef ;
    cof:pageNumber "228"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Reporting medicine shortages is prohibited for individuals and bodies corporate." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
