    skos:prefLabel "30EF(7) Reporting medicine shortages"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30ef-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) Subsection (6) does not apply if: (a) paragraph (1)(a) and subsection (3) apply in relation to the shortage but subsection (2) does not; and  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
