doc:sec-30eg-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "30EG(2) Reporting discontinuation of supply of medicine" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The discontinuation of the supply of a medicine in Australia is likely to be of critical impact if, when the discontinuation decision is made, the medicine is included in an instrument under section 30EJ." ;
