concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30eg-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30EG(5) Reporting discontinuation of supply of medicine"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30eg-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) An approval of a form may require or permit information to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(5) An approval of a form may require or permit information to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
