concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30ej a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30EJ Medicines Watch List"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30ej ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine medicine for the purposes of subsections 30EF(2) and 30EG(2). (2) The Minister must not determine a medicine unless the Minister is satisfied that any shortage of the medicine, or any permanent discontinuation of the supply of the medicine, in Australia has the potential to result in: (a) significant morbidity in patients in Australia; or (b) the death of one or more patients in Australia.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine medicine for the purposes of subsections 30EF(2) and 30EG(2). (2) The Minister must not determine a medicine unless the Minister is satisfied that any shortage of the medicine, or any permanent discontinuation of the supply of the medicine, in Australia has the potential to result in: (a) significant morbidity in patients in Australia; or (b) the death of one or more patients in Australia.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "610a407ee592ecba0f67faf3aaa9c5d90c1795f53b511ca5be5d6c551754281f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "235"^^xsd:integer ;
