concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30f-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30F(5) Criminal offences for goods exempt under section 18A not"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30f-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A person commits an offence if: (a) the Secretary gives a notice to the person under subsection (2); and (b) the notice specifies a particular requirement mentioned in subsection (3); and (c) the person fails to comply with that requirement. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or both." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A person commits an offence if: (a) the Secretary gives a notice to the person under subsection (2); and (b) the notice specifies a particular requirement mentioned in subsection (3); and (c) the person fails to comply with that requirement. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or both."@en ;
