concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31B Secretary may require information relating to approvals and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-31b ;
    values:originalText "authorities under section 19 Approval under subsection 19(1) (1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval under subsection 19(1) in relation to specified therapeutic goods a written notice requiring the person to give to the Secretary  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "authorities under section 19 Approval under subsection 19(1) (1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval under subsection 19(1) in relation to specified therapeutic goods a written notice requiring the person to give to the Secretary  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
