    skos:definition "(1) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person is given a notice under section 31A, 31AA, 31B or 31BA; and (b) the person fails to comply with the notice.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Registration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2 General  Division 3 Section 31D Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 Penalty: 400 penalty units."@en ;
