doc:sec-32bg-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "32BG(1A) Criminal offences and civil penalty relating to a failure to" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person: (i) imports a biological into Australia for use in humans; or (ii) exports a biological from Australia for use in humans; or  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
