concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32bk a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32BK Civil penalty for making misrepresentations about biologicals"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32bk ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person contravenes this section if: (a) the person makes a representation of a kind referred to in subsection (2); and (b) the representation is false or misleading. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—5,000 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—50,000 penalty units. (2) Subsection (1) applies to the following representations: (a) representations that a biological is included in the Register; (b) representations that a person is exempt under subsection 32CA(1) in relation to a biological or that a biological is exempt under subsection 32CA(2); (c) representations that a biological is exempt under section 32CB; (d) representations that a biological is the subject of an approval under subsection 32CK(1); (e) representations that a biological is the subject of an authority under subsection 32CM(1) or (7A);  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Biologicals  Part 3-2A Main criminal offences and civil penalties  Division 2 Section 32BL Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (f) representations that a biological is the subject of an approval under subsection 32CO(1), (1A) or (2)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person contravenes this section if: (a) the person makes a representation of a kind referred to in subsection (2); and (b) the representation is false or misleading. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—5,000 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—50,000 penalty units. (2) Subsection (1) applies to the following representations: (a) representations that a biological is included in the Register; (b) representations that a person is exempt under subsection 32CA(1) in relation to a biological or that a biological is exempt under subsection 32CA(2); (c) representations that a biological is exempt under section 32CB; (d) representations that a biological is the subject of an approval under subsection 32CK(1); (e) representations that a biological is the subject of an authority under subsection 32CM(1) or (7A);  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Biologicals  Part 3-2A Main criminal offences and civil penalties  Division 2 Section 32BL Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (f) representations that a biological is the subject of an approval under subsection 32CO(1), (1A) or (2)."@en ;
