concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ca-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32CA(5) Exempt biologicals"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32ca-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the regulations revoke an exemption, the revocation takes effect on the day specified in the regulations. The day must not be earlier  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Biologicals  Part 3-2A Exemptions  Division 3 Section 32CB Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 than 28 days after the day on which the regulations revoking the exemption take effect. Subdivision C—Exempting biologicals to deal with emergencies" ;
    skos:definition "(5) If the regulations revoke an exemption, the revocation takes effect on the day specified in the regulations. The day must not be earlier  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Biologicals  Part 3-2A Exemptions  Division 3 Section 32CB Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 than 28 days after the day on which the regulations revoking the exemption take effect. Subdivision C—Exempting biologicals to deal with emergencies"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2ca56c6529b8857c8521bb0ef230cb25379c9023e083819165ea2a7fde94ab34" ;
