    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Minister may, by writing: (a) vary the conditions of an exemption made under section 32CB (including by imposing new conditions); or (b) revoke the conditions of an exemption made under section 32CB.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
