concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ck-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32CK(5) Approvals for importing, exporting or supplying a biological"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32ck-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If an application for an approval is made, the Secretary must: (a) after having considered the application; and (b) in the case of an application for an approval for use of the kind referred to in paragraph (1)(e)—after having evaluated the information submitted with the application; notify the applicant of the decision on the application as soon as practicable after making the decision and, in the case of a decision not to grant the approval, of the reasons for the decision.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(5) If an application for an approval is made, the Secretary must: (a) after having considered the application; and (b) in the case of an application for an approval for use of the kind referred to in paragraph (1)(e)—after having evaluated the information submitted with the application; notify the applicant of the decision on the application as soon as practicable after making the decision and, in the case of a decision not to grant the approval, of the reasons for the decision.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1f01bb9a50b4abd4ae6370b9c2e964457ea7a388cba31f44448dc0ce383de087" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ck ;
    cof:pageNumber "296"^^xsd:integer ;
