concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32CM(2) Authorities for health practitioners"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32cm-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Secretary may give an authority under subsection (1) subject to any conditions that are specified in the authority. Note: There are criminal offences and a civil penalty related to the breach of a condition of an authority: see sections 32CP and 32CQ." ;
