concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32CM(3) Authorities for health practitioners"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32cm-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Secretary may impose conditions (or further conditions) on an authority given to a person under subsection (1) by giving to the person written notice of the conditions (or further conditions). Note: There are criminal offences and a civil penalty related to the breach of a condition of an authority: see sections 32CP and 32CQ." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Secretary may impose conditions (or further conditions) on an authority given to a person under subsection (1) by giving to the person written notice of the conditions (or further conditions). Note: There are criminal offences and a civil penalty related to the breach of a condition of an authority: see sections 32CP and 32CQ."@en ;
