    values:originalText "(5) An authority under subsection (1) may only be given in relation to a class or classes of recipients prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this subsection.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Biologicals  Part 3-2A Exemptions  Division 3 Section 32CM Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
