concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-7a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32CM(7A) Authorities for health practitioners"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32cm-ss-7a ;
    values:originalText "(7A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules authorising any health practitioner who is included in a specified class of health practitioners to supply a specified biological, for use in the treatment of humans, to the class or classes of recipients specified in those rules, so long as: (a) the biological is supplied in the circumstances specified in those rules; and (b) the conditions (if any) specified in those rules are satisfied." ;
    skos:definition "(7A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules authorising any health practitioner who is included in a specified class of health practitioners to supply a specified biological, for use in the treatment of humans, to the class or classes of recipients specified in those rules, so long as: (a) the biological is supplied in the circumstances specified in those rules; and (b) the conditions (if any) specified in those rules are satisfied."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "72fbee116e9bcf24c7ddfea9fd972b87404fc52111ca4aa9d8b9c2ddef45e7a5" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm ;
    cof:pageNumber "300"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Minister may make rules authorising health practitioners to supply biologicals." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.300" ;
