doc:sec-32cm-ss-7a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "32CM(7A) Authorities for health practitioners" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules authorising any health practitioner who is included in a specified class of health practitioners to supply a specified biological, for use in the treatment of humans, to the class or classes of recipients specified in those rules, so long as: (a) the biological is supplied in the circumstances specified in those rules; and (b) the conditions (if any) specified in those rules are satisfied." ;
    cof:pageNumber "300"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-7b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32CM(7B) Authorities for health practitioners"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32cm-ss-7b ;
    values:originalText "(7B) In making rules under subsection (7A), the Minister must comply with: (a) such requirements (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations; and (b) such restrictions (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations; and (c) such limitations (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations." ;
    skos:definition "(7B) In making rules under subsection (7A), the Minister must comply with: (a) such requirements (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations; and (b) such restrictions (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations; and (c) such limitations (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5bf3e89932880e5235525b23527e7e83a18538df47d215d5a7796ba43d44e333" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm ;
    cof:pageNumber "300"^^xsd:integer ;
