concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-7c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32CM(7C) Authorities for health practitioners"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32cm-ss-7c ;
    values:originalText "(7C) If: (a) a person is authorised, by subsection (7A) rules, to supply a biological; and (b) the person supplies the biological in accordance with those rules; the person must: (c) notify the supply to the Secretary; and (d) do so within 28 days after the supply." ;
    skos:definition "(7C) If: (a) a person is authorised, by subsection (7A) rules, to supply a biological; and (b) the person supplies the biological in accordance with those rules; the person must: (c) notify the supply to the Secretary; and (d) do so within 28 days after the supply."@en ;
