    skos:prefLabel "32CM(7D) Authorities for health practitioners"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32cm-ss-7d ;
    values:originalText "(7D) A notification under subsection (7C) must: (a) be in accordance with a form that is approved, in writing, by the Secretary; and (b) contain such information as is prescribed by the regulations." ;
