concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cq a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32CQ Civil penalty for breaching a condition of an exemption,"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32cq ;
    values:originalText "approval or authority A person contravenes this section if: (a) the person does an act or omits to do an act; and (b) the act or omission breaches: (i) a condition of an exemption applicable under regulations made for the purposes of subsection 32CA(3); or (ii) a condition of an exemption under section 32CB; or (iii) a condition of an approval under section 32CK; or (iv) a condition applicable under regulations made for the purposes of section 32CL; or (v) a condition of an authority under section 32CM; or  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "approval or authority A person contravenes this section if: (a) the person does an act or omits to do an act; and (b) the act or omission breaches: (i) a condition of an exemption applicable under regulations made for the purposes of subsection 32CA(3); or (ii) a condition of an exemption under section 32CB; or (iii) a condition of an approval under section 32CK; or (iv) a condition applicable under regulations made for the purposes of section 32CL; or (v) a condition of an authority under section 32CM; or  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ea9efe8d6f0548fb8b1ca5664514395015c34dd9ce1b68313dbc4de1b98ebdca" ;
    cof:pageNumber "311"^^xsd:integer ;
