concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dq a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32DQ Criminal offence and civil penalty for failing to notify adverse"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32dq ;
    values:originalText "effects etc. of biological while it is included in the Register Criminal offence (1) A person commits an offence if: (a) a biological is included in the Register in relation to the person; and (b) the person knows that particular information is information of a kind to which subsection (3) applies; and (c) the person fails to give that information to the Secretary within the period specified in the regulations (whether or not the person has already given to the Secretary other information relating to the same matter).  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "effects etc. of biological while it is included in the Register Criminal offence (1) A person commits an offence if: (a) a biological is included in the Register in relation to the person; and (b) the person knows that particular information is information of a kind to which subsection (3) applies; and (c) the person fails to give that information to the Secretary within the period specified in the regulations (whether or not the person has already given to the Secretary other information relating to the same matter).  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "df485be7af1475b18b8908e5d1492812ab83aa3d0c56e543cade0fff9e83ba1e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "335"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Failure to notify adverse effects of a biological included in the Register is an offence." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
