concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dt a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32DT Secretary may seek advice about classes of GM products or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32dt ;
    values:originalText "genetically modified organisms (1) The Secretary may request advice from the Gene Technology Regulator in relation to: (a) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, a GM product belonging to a class of GM products specified in the request; or (b) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, genetically modified organisms belonging to a class of genetically modified organisms specified in the request.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "genetically modified organisms (1) The Secretary may request advice from the Gene Technology Regulator in relation to: (a) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, a GM product belonging to a class of GM products specified in the request; or (b) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, genetically modified organisms belonging to a class of genetically modified organisms specified in the request.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8b9f3a54fe96d74cd996e8477e33a6ea12d240d714f3bdf2cd697b3e7d18ab19" ;
    cof:pageNumber "339"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Secretary may request advice from the Gene Technology Regulator about specific GM products or organisms." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.339" ;
    cml:asserts concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dt-norm .
concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dt-norm a values:Obligation ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dt ;
    values:borneBy values:Agent ;
    values:deonticStatus values:HeuristicDerived ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sec-32dt a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "32DT Secretary may seek advice about classes of GM products or" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "genetically modified organisms (1) The Secretary may request advice from the Gene Technology Regulator in relation to: (a) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, a GM product belonging to a class of GM products specified in the request; or (b) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, genetically modified organisms belonging to a class of genetically modified organisms specified in the request.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    cof:pageNumber "339"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32du a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32DU Secretary to take advice into account"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32du ;
    values:originalText "If the Secretary receives advice from the Gene Technology Regulator: (a) in response to a notice under section 32DS within the period specified in the notice; or (b) under section 32DT; the Secretary must: (c) ensure that the advice is taken into account in making a decision on the application to which the notice relates, or on an application to which the advice under section 32DT relates, as the case requires; and (d) inform the Gene Technology Regulator of the decision on the application.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Biologicals  Part 3-2A Conditions  Division 5 Section 32E Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    skos:definition "If the Secretary receives advice from the Gene Technology Regulator: (a) in response to a notice under section 32DS within the period specified in the notice; or (b) under section 32DT; the Secretary must: (c) ensure that the advice is taken into account in making a decision on the application to which the notice relates, or on an application to which the advice under section 32DT relates, as the case requires; and (d) inform the Gene Technology Regulator of the decision on the application.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Biologicals  Part 3-2A Conditions  Division 5 Section 32E Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1197cb1929b5c8073f900c10e133b790e91c1ee4285eeaeae25a7eccd5e314bc" ;
    cof:pageNumber "340"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Secretary must take advice into account when making a decision on an application." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
