    skos:prefLabel "32ED Imposition of conditions at time biological included in the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32ed ;
    values:originalText "Register (1) If the Secretary includes a biological in the Register in relation to a person, the Secretary may, by notice in writing given to the person, impose conditions on the inclusion of the biological in the Register. (2) A notice under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument." ;
