concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32fd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32FD Effect of suspension"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32fd ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a biological is suspended from the Register under section 32FA, the biological is taken, for the purposes of this Act (other than section 32DQ, Division 5, sections 32FB and 32FC and Divisions 7 and 9), not to be included in the Register while the suspension has effect. Note: Dealing in a biological that is not included in the Register may be a criminal offence or may contravene a civil penalty provision: see" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If a biological is suspended from the Register under section 32FA, the biological is taken, for the purposes of this Act (other than section 32DQ, Division 5, sections 32FB and 32FC and Divisions 7 and 9), not to be included in the Register while the suspension has effect. Note: Dealing in a biological that is not included in the Register may be a criminal offence or may contravene a civil penalty provision: see"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a2d5f0c0c50f79eef3d0f6d304c15f2ca9053c4a1b87a067a6ce345c54b24253" ;
    cof:pageNumber "352"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Dealing in a biological not included in the Register may be a criminal offence or contravene a civil penalty provision." ;
