concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32gd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32GD Revocation of cancellation of biological upon request"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32gd ;
    values:originalText "(1) If: (a) the Secretary cancels the entry of a biological from the Register because of the request of a person made under paragraph 32GA(1)(d); and (b) before the end of the period of 90 days beginning on the day the biological ceased to be included in the Register, the person requests, in writing, the Secretary to revoke the cancellation; and (c) the request is accompanied by the prescribed application fee;  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If: (a) the Secretary cancels the entry of a biological from the Register because of the request of a person made under paragraph 32GA(1)(d); and (b) before the end of the period of 90 days beginning on the day the biological ceased to be included in the Register, the person requests, in writing, the Secretary to revoke the cancellation; and (c) the request is accompanied by the prescribed application fee;  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e7590ed4953ed0a9be12e0af8b07efd787cdc4b79c8b4f1e37e8c583ba32a5df" ;
    cof:pageNumber "357"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Request for revocation of cancellation of biological upon request" ;
    dc:description "Application fee" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
