doc:sec-32gd a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "32GD Revocation of cancellation of biological upon request" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If: (a) the Secretary cancels the entry of a biological from the Register because of the request of a person made under paragraph 32GA(1)(d); and (b) before the end of the period of 90 days beginning on the day the biological ceased to be included in the Register, the person requests, in writing, the Secretary to revoke the cancellation; and (c) the request is accompanied by the prescribed application fee;  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    cof:pageNumber "357"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ge a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32GE Publication of cancellation of entry from Register"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32ge ;
    values:originalText "The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website, as soon as practicable after cancelling an entry of a biological from the Register, a notice setting out particulars of the cancellation.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Biologicals  Part 3-2A Cancellation from the Register  Division 7 Section 32GF Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    skos:definition "The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website, as soon as practicable after cancelling an entry of a biological from the Register, a notice setting out particulars of the cancellation.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Biologicals  Part 3-2A Cancellation from the Register  Division 7 Section 32GF Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bb3dee238e862e9591907502045fe8abe26e8332e4af67384d0018b09c2c591d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "358"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Publish notice of cancellation from Register" ;
    dc:description "Notice with particulars of cancellation" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
