    cof:title "32HB Publication of requirements" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website, as soon as practicable after imposing a requirement under section 32HA, a notice setting out particulars of the requirement." ;
