    values:originalText "(5) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person does an act or omits to do an act; and (b) the act or omission breaches a requirement imposed on the person under section 32HA.  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Biologicals  Part 3-2A Public notification, and recall, of biologicals  Division 8 Section 32HD Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 Penalty: 100 penalty units." ;
    cof:pageNumber "364"^^xsd:integer .

