concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32hd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32HD Civil penalty for non-compliance with requirements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32hd ;
    values:originalText "A person contravenes this section if: (a) the person does an act or omits to do an act; and (b) the act or omission breaches a requirement imposed on the person under section 32HA. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—5,000 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—50,000 penalty units." ;
    skos:definition "A person contravenes this section if: (a) the person does an act or omits to do an act; and (b) the act or omission breaches a requirement imposed on the person under section 32HA. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—5,000 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—50,000 penalty units."@en ;
