concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32j a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32J What this Division is about"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32j ;
    values:originalText "The Secretary may by written notice seek information or documents relating to: • applications for inclusion of biologicals in the Register; or • biologicals included in the Register; or • the supply of, and other matters relating to, biologicals covered by exemptions under Division 3. There are criminal offences for failing to comply with a notice and for giving false or misleading information or documents and civil penalties for giving false or misleading information or documents. Subdivision B—Obtaining information or documents for biologicals included or proposed to be included in the Register" ;
    skos:definition "The Secretary may by written notice seek information or documents relating to: • applications for inclusion of biologicals in the Register; or • biologicals included in the Register; or • the supply of, and other matters relating to, biologicals covered by exemptions under Division 3. There are criminal offences for failing to comply with a notice and for giving false or misleading information or documents and civil penalties for giving false or misleading information or documents. Subdivision B—Obtaining information or documents for biologicals included or proposed to be included in the Register"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a4b8b329d56528433ed5a3b2f123d18a50c9b3e1c1762789996b5547bdb92100" ;
    cof:pageNumber "366"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Secretary may seek information or documents from applicants, biologicals included in the Register, and suppliers of exempted biologicals." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.366" ;
    cml:asserts concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32j-norm .
