    skos:definition "(2) However, in the case of an individual: (a) the information given or the document produced; and (b) giving the information or producing the document; and  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3 Biologicals  Part 3-2A Obtaining information or documents  Division 9 Section 32JL Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (c) any information, document or thing obtained as a direct or indirect consequence of giving the information or producing the document; are not admissible in evidence against the individual: (d) in criminal proceedings, except proceedings for an offence against subsection 32JI(1), (1A), (2) or (3); or (e) in civil proceedings, except proceedings under section 42Y for a contravention of section 32JJ. Subdivision D—Inspecting, copying and retaining documents"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c90302cc6bdad7bdb74b2882b4f4cb9f67fa280648908d982dabd2d26ccb1331" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32jk ;
