    cof:title "36 Manufacturing principles" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, from time to time, determine written principles to be observed in the manufacture of therapeutic goods for use in humans.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
