concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-37-ss-1b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "37(1B) Application for licence"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-37-ss-1b ;
    values:originalText "(1B) If an applicant is of the view that, having regard to the guidelines under section 38A, a licence could be granted covering 2 or more manufacturing sites, the applicant may: (a) identify those sites in the application; and (b) state the applicant’s reasons for the applicant’s view.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(1B) If an applicant is of the view that, having regard to the guidelines under section 38A, a licence could be granted covering 2 or more manufacturing sites, the applicant may: (a) identify those sites in the application; and (b) state the applicant’s reasons for the applicant’s view.  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
