concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-40a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40A Variation of manufacturing site authorisations—Secretary’s"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40a ;
    values:originalText "own initiative (1) The Secretary may, on his or her own initiative and by notice in writing given to the holder of a licence, vary a manufacturing site authorisation in relation to the licence. (2) A variation under subsection (1) takes effect:  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "own initiative (1) The Secretary may, on his or her own initiative and by notice in writing given to the holder of a licence, vary a manufacturing site authorisation in relation to the licence. (2) A variation under subsection (1) takes effect:  Chapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "772cef773de65c05e8af2d38d0f6ff0d833e257ee5dd5d0377e439cbc856c9f0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "397"^^xsd:integer ;
