concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ac a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41AC Criminal offence for contravening a requirement in a notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41ac ;
    values:originalText "under section 41AB A person commits an offence if: (a) the person has been given a notice under section 41AB; and (b) the person omits to do an act; and (c) the omission contravenes a requirement in the notice. Penalty: 400 penalty units." ;
    skos:definition "under section 41AB A person commits an offence if: (a) the person has been given a notice under section 41AB; and (b) the person omits to do an act; and (c) the omission contravenes a requirement in the notice. Penalty: 400 penalty units."@en ;
